  (text "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 (N8/N8R2) in 2x22 sockets. Program & log via the \"UART\" USB port only:\nGPIO19/20 (USB-OTG) are used as I2C bus B. GPIO35-37 left free (octal PSRAM on R8 variants),\nGPIO38/48 = on-board RGB LED."
