  (text "Hardware E-stop: ACT_EN (GPIO39) is looped through the NC E-stop contact; loop open or ESP not\ndriving -> 74HCT244 outputs Hi-Z -> 10k pull-downs -> all IBT-2 PWM/EN low. Fit a wire bridge\nif no E-stop is used."
